{"1120330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sky of Tides", "steam_appid": 1120330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/5caec4e11d688454ca30a820c2cf972b.avif?t=1787154973\" width=1168 height=468 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the world of <strong>numen9</strong> shattered, its oceans rose into the sky and left nine fractured realms hanging above an exposed molten core known as the <strong>Inner Sun</strong>. Crystal wastelands burn with radiation. Strange creatures roam the ruins. And somewhere beyond the sky-seas, Rin D’Lorah’s father has vanished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Rin</strong>, a young woman pulled into a planetary mystery far greater than herself. Across <strong>nine fully voiced episodes</strong>, you will explore a broken sci-fi world, uncover the truth behind numen9’s collapse, and shape Rin into the person she becomes. Every dialogue choice, every discovery, and every risk you take will leave its mark — on Rin, on the people around her, and on the fate of the world itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/4229ab46f0e419590c436076120c500e.poster.avif?t=1787154973\" width=1168 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/4229ab46f0e419590c436076120c500e.webm?t=1787154973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/4229ab46f0e419590c436076120c500e.mp4?t=1787154973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>story-driven isometric adventure</strong> where character matters as much as plot. Your decisions build Rin across <strong>five core traits</strong>: <strong>Intelligence, Humor, Courage, Compassion, and Luck</strong>. Push too hard in one direction and you may survive — but lose yourself in the process. In <strong>Sky of Tides</strong>, true power comes not from min-maxing, but from <strong>balance</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/46767fca5479c15172c6527eb3631b64.poster.avif?t=1787154973\" width=1168 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/46767fca5479c15172c6527eb3631b64.webm?t=1787154973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/46767fca5479c15172c6527eb3631b64.mp4?t=1787154973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to unforgettable characters who have their own agendas, opinions, and tempers. Search ancient locations for hidden objects and long-buried truths. Unlock powerful suits that enhance your evolving stats and open new ways to face the journey ahead. Beneath its vibrant science-fantasy world lies a branching narrative with <strong>different endings</strong>, where your version of Rin determines which future numen9 receives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/1ad3de50b6b6f599b9a7b386bc6c63bf.poster.avif?t=1787154973\" width=1168 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/1ad3de50b6b6f599b9a7b386bc6c63bf.webm?t=1787154973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/1ad3de50b6b6f599b9a7b386bc6c63bf.mp4?t=1787154973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you achieve true balance, the story goes even further: unlock the game’s <strong>true ending</strong> and gain access to <strong>Sky of Tides: Atla</strong>, a five-episode animated series set in the same universe, watchable directly inside the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A branching choice-driven adventure</strong> with<strong> multiplay endings</strong> shaped by your decisions and character growth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique <strong>balance-based progression system</strong> built around 5 personality stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a fractured sci-fi world from an <strong>isometric perspective</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden objects, ancient secrets, and the truth behind numen9’s fall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>customization suits</strong> that boost and reshape Rin’s abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full English voice acting featuring acclaimed actors and creators</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a <strong>bonus animated series</strong> inside the game by reaching the true ending</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/770cd9d4d1231635363c9ca3aca2e539.poster.avif?t=1787154973\" width=1168 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/770cd9d4d1231635363c9ca3aca2e539.webm?t=1787154973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/770cd9d4d1231635363c9ca3aca2e539.mp4?t=1787154973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love <strong>choice-heavy narrative games</strong>, <strong>character-driven mysteries</strong>, and <strong>worlds that reward curiosity</strong>, <strong>Sky of Tides</strong> invites you to lose yourself in a beautiful collapse — and decide what rises from it.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/5caec4e11d688454ca30a820c2cf972b.avif?t=1787154973\" width=1168 height=468 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the world of <strong>numen9</strong> shattered, its oceans rose into the sky and left nine fractured realms hanging above an exposed molten core known as the <strong>Inner Sun</strong>. Crystal wastelands burn with radiation. Strange creatures roam the ruins. And somewhere beyond the sky-seas, Rin D’Lorah’s father has vanished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Rin</strong>, a young woman pulled into a planetary mystery far greater than herself. Across <strong>nine fully voiced episodes</strong>, you will explore a broken sci-fi world, uncover the truth behind numen9’s collapse, and shape Rin into the person she becomes. Every dialogue choice, every discovery, and every risk you take will leave its mark — on Rin, on the people around her, and on the fate of the world itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/4229ab46f0e419590c436076120c500e.poster.avif?t=1787154973\" width=1168 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/4229ab46f0e419590c436076120c500e.webm?t=1787154973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/4229ab46f0e419590c436076120c500e.mp4?t=1787154973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>story-driven isometric adventure</strong> where character matters as much as plot. Your decisions build Rin across <strong>five core traits</strong>: <strong>Intelligence, Humor, Courage, Compassion, and Luck</strong>. Push too hard in one direction and you may survive — but lose yourself in the process. In <strong>Sky of Tides</strong>, true power comes not from min-maxing, but from <strong>balance</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/46767fca5479c15172c6527eb3631b64.poster.avif?t=1787154973\" width=1168 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/46767fca5479c15172c6527eb3631b64.webm?t=1787154973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/46767fca5479c15172c6527eb3631b64.mp4?t=1787154973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to unforgettable characters who have their own agendas, opinions, and tempers. Search ancient locations for hidden objects and long-buried truths. Unlock powerful suits that enhance your evolving stats and open new ways to face the journey ahead. Beneath its vibrant science-fantasy world lies a branching narrative with <strong>different endings</strong>, where your version of Rin determines which future numen9 receives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1120330/extras/1ad3de50b6b6f599b9a7b386bc6c63bf.poster.avif?t=1787154973\" width=1168 height=456 ><source src